---
import { siteNavigation } from "@/data/place";

const exploreNavigation = siteNavigation.slice(0, 3);
const toolNavigation = siteNavigation.slice(3);
const currentYear = new Date().getFullYear();
---
<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="footer-shell">
    <div class="footer-main">
      <div class="footer-intro">
        <a class="footer-brand" href="/" aria-label="龍門の滝 ホーム">
          <img src="/logo.svg" alt="" width="54" height="54" />
          <span>
            <strong>龍門の滝</strong>
            <small>RYUMON FALLS · NASUKARASUYAMA</small>
          </span>
        </a>
        <p>水音、民話、列車の風景が重なる場所へ。四季の見どころと旅の準備を、静かにまとめた水辺案内です。</p>
        <span class="footer-location">栃木県那須烏山市</span>
      </div>

      <nav class="footer-column" aria-label="見どころナビゲーション">
        <h2>見つける</h2>
        <ul class="footer-links">
          {exploreNavigation.map((item) => <li><a href={item.href}>{item.label}</a></li>)}
        </ul>
      </nav>

      <nav class="footer-column" aria-label="旅のツールナビゲーション">
        <h2>旅のツール</h2>
        <ul class="footer-links">
          {toolNavigation.map((item) => <li><a href={item.href}>{item.label}</a></li>)}
          <li><a href="/">トップページ</a></li>
        </ul>
      </nav>
    </div>

    <div class="footer-bottom">
      <div class="footer-meta">
        <span>© {currentYear} 龍門の滝</span>
        <a href="#page-top">ページ上部へ <span aria-hidden="true">↑</span></a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
